  "project_description": "This project provides support to develop XML-RPC clients and servers. It combines:\n\n \n A git subtree split of the XML-RPC core module \n An example module for developers wishing to implement XML-RPC clients and servers. \n \n Prior to Drupal 8, XML-RPC had been bundled in Drupal core since 2001, and the example code was, accordingly, in the Examples for Developers project.\n\n Since XML-RPC was taken out of core during the development, the examples were brought under this same package to keep the whole a consistent package.",
